{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>My spirit shall not abide in man.</b> When their souls ascend on high, I will not return them. Another explanation: I will no longer create a soul for man." "<b>בשגם הוא בשר.</b> It is a notarikon of משה; its numerical value is the same as its numerical value." "<b>And his days shall be etc.</b> The days of Moses. And it seems to me that this is the meaning of the verse: ״My spirit shall not abide in man״ — until Moses comes, who will have a good inclination, which is ״a heart of flesh,״ as it is written ״ונתתי לכם לב בשר״, and this is ״בשגם הוא בשר״."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:05:04.157897450Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}